1
00:00:00,311 --> 00:00:02,021
(Sheldon:)What if a simulated van rear-ends me?

2
00:00:02,187 --> 00:00:04,937
(Penny:)I'll hit you in the face with a pillow.

3
00:00:10,487 --> 00:00:12,197
[ENGINE STARTS ON SIMULATOR]

4
00:00:13,782 --> 00:00:15,992
(Leonard:)Okay, now shift into drive.

5
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,290
And pull out slowly into traffic.

6
00:00:18,454 --> 00:00:19,664
[TIRES SCREECHING ON SIMULATOR]

7
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,710
Do you...? Watch the...

8
00:00:21,874 --> 00:00:24,794
- Watch out for the pedestrians!
- Oh, God, wait.

9
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,000
[GIRL SCREAMS ON SIMULATOR]

10
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:27,550
Hit the brakes! Hit the brakes!

11
00:00:27,713 --> 00:00:28,963
[TIRES SCREECH ON SIMULATOR]

12
00:00:29,131 --> 00:00:31,051
[CAR CRASHES ON SIMULATOR]

13
00:00:39,725 --> 00:00:41,355
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

14
00:00:42,853 --> 00:00:44,603
[CAR CRASHES THEN MAN YELLS
ON SIMULATOR]

15
00:00:44,772 --> 00:00:46,942
Sorry. Excuse me.

16
00:00:47,107 --> 00:00:48,857
[TIRES SCREECH THEN CAR CRASHES
ON SIMULATOR]

17
00:00:49,026 --> 00:00:50,486
(Sheldon:)My bad.

18
00:00:50,986 --> 00:00:52,866
[TIRES SCREECH THEN GLASS SHATTERS
ON SIMULATOR]

19
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:55,030
(Sheldon:)Student driver.

20
00:00:56,325 --> 00:01:00,285
(Leonard:)How did you manage to get on
the second floor of the Glendale Galleria?

